       measurably slower, softer assist than what shipped in the app and in
       AIM_ENGINE_V2.md, on every single boot (this function re-runs each
       init while profile==FEROZ - see the init block below). That is almost
       certainly the "aim speed feels slow / not as strong" report.
       Also bumped GAIN 100 -> 115 (a modest +15% master boost via the
       dedicated multiplier) in response to the same "not as strong" report -
       kept off AA STRENGTH itself so it is one clean, reversible lever.    */
    if (p == 1) {
